NA, SAP Implementierung, SAP Projektmanagement, SAP PS, SAP Security, SAP Solution Manager, Sas/base, Systemarchitektur, SAP CX, SAP Qualtrics, Cloud Platform, SAP-Integrationen, RISE with SAP, SAP HCM, SAP C4C",
